msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Engin hreyfing` — fjarlægir alla hreyfilykilramma úr klippunni."

#: ../clips.rst:266
msgid ":guilabel:`In` — entrance animations applied at the start of the clip:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Inn` — inngangs hreyfimyndir beittar í byrjun klippunnar:"

#: ../clips.rst:268
msgid ""
"**Back In** (From Bottom / Left / Right / Top) — clip overshoots and springs"
" back into position."
msgstr ""
"**Bak Inn** (Frá Neðri / Vinstri / Hægri / Efri) — klippan fer fram úr og "
