#: ../clips.rst:269
msgid "**Blur In** — clip fades in from a motion blur."
msgstr "**Óskýrt Inn** — klippan fæðir inn úr hreyfióskýrleika."

#: ../clips.rst:270
msgid ""
"**Bounce In** (Center / From Bottom / Left / Right / Top) — clip bounces as "
"it enters."
msgstr ""
"**Hoppa Inn** (Miðja / Frá Neðri / Vinstri / Hægri / Efri) — klippan hoppar "
