"óskýrleika í fókus."

#: ../clips.rst:272
msgid "**Pop In** — clip scales up quickly from nothing."
msgstr "**Poppa Inn** — klippan stækkar hratt úr engu."

#: ../clips.rst:273
msgid ""
"**Slide In** (From Bottom / Left / Right / Top) — clip slides onto the "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"**Renna Inn** (Frá Neðri / Vinstri / Hægri / Efri) — klippan rennur inn á "
"skjáinn."

#: ../clips.rst:274
msgid "**Spiral In** — clip rotates in while scaling up."
msgstr "**Spírala Inn** — klippan snýst inn á meðan hún stækkar."

#: ../clips.rst:275
msgid ""
"**Wipe In** (Circle Expand / Circle Shrink / From Bottom / Left / Right / "
"Top) — clip is revealed by a wipe."
msgstr ""
"**Þurrka Inn** (Hringur Stækkar / Hringur Minnkar / Frá Neðri / Vinstri / "
"Hægri / Efri) — klippan birtist með þurrkun."

